# GiorgiOS Pixel 9 Edition

A Pixel-inspired Android system project for Samsung Galaxy A05.

## Target device
- Model: Samsung Galaxy A05 (SM-A055F)
- Codename: a05m
- Architecture: ARM64
- Vendor base: Android 15

## Status
Early development. This is not yet a flashable ROM.

## Goal
Develop and test a compatible Pixel-inspired Android system for the Galaxy A05.
